{
  "id": "unique-event-015",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "unique-event-015:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "#15 - Wearing the mask\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,1155,1178]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-015:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You put on the mask. It fits snugly\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,1178,1214]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-015:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "on your face. You feel an evil\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,1214,1245]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-015:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "presence trying to take control of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,1245,1280]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-015:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you. Save vs. L5 Magic (roll at +1 if\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,1280,1318]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-015:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you have the Will Skill, at +2 if you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,1318,1356]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-015:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have it at Expert level). If you make\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,1356,1394]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-015:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "it, you lose 1 Sanity and will have\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,1394,1430]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-015:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "-2 on all Charisma rolls until you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,1430,1465]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-015:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "find a way to break the curse. If\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,1465,1499]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-015:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "your Sanity reaches 0 or lower, you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,1499,1535]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-015:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "will haunt this area until someone\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,1535,1570]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-015:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "kills you and takes the mask for\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,1570,1603]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-015:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "themselves.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,1603,1615]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    83
  ]
}
